{"id":"978bb51599bc5702","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-cantor-measure.md","title":"Cantor 概率测度","display":"df-cantor-measure — Cantor 概率测度","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-cantor-measure","aliases":["20-df-cantor-measure"],"display":"df-cantor-measure — Cantor 概率测度","chapter":"11","section":"11.1","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"§11.1 的 measure 定义","source_pdf_pages":[220],"source_printed_pages":[189],"depends_on":["[[20-df-cantor-space]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-cantor-measure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-cantor-measure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-cantor-measure — Cantor 概率测度"},{"key":"chapter","html":"11"},{"key":"section","html":"11.1"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"§11.1 的 measure 定义"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>220</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>189</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ef101d71722ee067\" href=\"?note=ef101d71722ee067\" title=\"20-df-cantor-space\">20-df-cantor-space</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^\\omega\">\\(2^\\omega\\)</span> 上的公平 Bernoulli 概率测度；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(S\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> 是前缀自由集，即不同元素互不为前缀。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ef101d71722ee067\" href=\"?note=ef101d71722ee067\" title=\"20-df-cantor-space\">20-df-cantor-space</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cantor\\text{-}measure}\\vdash\n\\mu([\\sigma])=2^{-|\\sigma|},\\qquad\n\\mu\\!\\left(\\bigcup_{\\sigma\\in S}[\\sigma]\\right)=\\sum_{\\sigma\\in S}2^{-|\\sigma|}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cantor\\text{-}measure}\\vdash\n\\mu([\\sigma])=2^{-|\\sigma|},\\qquad\n\\mu\\!\\left(\\bigcup_{\\sigma\\in S}[\\sigma]\\right)=\\sum_{\\sigma\\in S}2^{-|\\sigma|}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>测度由柱集概率唯一延伸到 Borel 集。任意开集可取其最短覆盖前缀组成前缀自由集；非前缀自由的覆盖不能直接相加，否则重叠会被重复计数。</p>\n<p>来源：§11.1 的 measure 定义；印刷页 189；PDF 第 220 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-cantor-space","status":"resolved","id":"ef101d71722ee067","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-cantor-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-cantor-space","status":"resolved","id":"ef101d71722ee067","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-cantor-space]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mu","display":false},{"tex":"2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"S\\subseteq2^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cantor\\text{-}measure}\\vdash\n\\mu([\\sigma])=2^{-|\\sigma|},\\qquad\n\\mu\\!\\left(\\bigcup_{\\sigma\\in S}[\\sigma]\\right)=\\sum_{\\sigma\\in S}2^{-|\\sigma|}.","display":true}],"bytes":1176,"backlinks":[{"id":"58f8766635c79a79","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt